---
layout: base
pageTitle: kochbloggers - Leckere Rezepte & Kochideen
metaDescription: Entdecke leckere Rezepte und Kochideen bei kochbloggers - von einfachen Alltagsgerichten bis zu besonderen Leckerbissen
scripts:
  - /assets/js/recipe-card-parallax.js
  - /assets/js/recipe-filter.js
---
<main>
    <section id="home" class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h2>Willkommen bei kochbloggers 🍳</h2>
            <p>Entdecke leckere Rezepte, einfache Kochideen und kulinarische Inspirationen. Von schnellen Alltagsgerichten bis zu besonderen Leckerbissen.</p>
            <button class="cta-button" onclick="location.href='#recipes'">Rezepte entdecken</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="recipes" class="recipes-section">
        <h2>Unsere Rezepte</h2>
        <div class="recipe-filters" aria-label="Rezepte filtern">
            <button type="button" class="tag-filter is-active" data-filter="alle">Alle</button>
            <button type="button" class="tag-filter" data-filter="schnell">Schnell</button>
            <button type="button" class="tag-filter" data-filter="fruehstueck">Fruehstueck</button>
            <button type="button" class="tag-filter" data-filter="salat">Salat</button>
            <button type="button" class="tag-filter" data-filter="backen">Backen</button>
            <button type="button" class="tag-filter" data-filter="abendessen">Abendessen</button>
            <button type="button" class="tag-filter" data-filter="dessert">Dessert</button>
            <button type="button" class="tag-filter" data-filter="proteinreich">Proteinreich</button>
            <span class="filter-selection-count" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="recipes-grid">
            {% set sortedRecipes = collections.recipes | sort(false, false, 'data.order') %}
            {% for recipe in sortedRecipes %}
            <a href="{{ recipe.url }}" class="recipe-card-link" data-tags="{{ recipe.data.filterTags }}">
                <div class="recipe-card">
                    <div class="recipe-image">
                        <img src="/assets/images/{{ recipe.data.image }}/hero.jpg" alt="{{ recipe.data.title }}">
                    </div>
                    <div class="recipe-content">
                        <h3>{{ recipe.data.title }}</h3>
                        <span class="cook-time">⏱️ {{ recipe.data.cookTime }}</span>
                        <p>{{ recipe.data.cardDescription }}</p>
                        <div class="recipe-tags" aria-label="Tags fuer {{ recipe.data.title }}">
                            {% for chip in recipe.data.tagChips %}
                            <span class="tag-chip">{{ chip }}</span>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}

            <div class="recipe-card coming-soon">
                <div class="recipe-image">
                    <img src="/assets/images/coming-soon.jpg" alt="Mehr Rezepte kommen bald">
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-content">
                    <h3>Mehr Rezepte kommen bald...</h3>
                    <span class="cook-time">In Planung</span>
                    <p>Wir arbeiten bereits an neuen Rezepten für euch. Schaut bald wieder vorbei.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
